@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam handwritten false
skinparam actorStyle awesome

title WF-1: Login Flow (v3.3)

participant "User\n(Browser)" as U #D5E8D4
participant "Core App\n(port 8000)" as CA #DAE8FC
participant "Detection Engine\n(port 8001)" as DE #FFE6CC
database "core-db\n(PostgreSQL)" as CDB #F5F5F5

== Login Request ==

U -> CA : **POST /api/v1/auth/login**\n(username, password;\neffective client IP from request.client.host)
activate CA

CA -> CDB : SELECT user WHERE username
activate CDB
CDB --> CA : user record\n(hash, status, mfa settings)
deactivate CDB

CA -> CA : Verify password (Argon2id)

alt credentials INVALID
    CA -> CDB : INSERT login_attempt\n(outcome=failure)
    CA --> U : **401 Invalid credentials**
    deactivate CA

else account LOCKED/SUSPENDED
    CA -> CDB : INSERT login_attempt\n(outcome=locked)
    CA --> U : **403 Account unavailable**
    deactivate CA

else credentials VALID
    == Risk gate (đồng bộ, 2026-10-05) ==
    CA -> DE : **POST /internal/pre-token-check**\n(username, user_id, ip, ua)\n(timeout 3s)
    activate DE
    DE --> CA : {risk_level, require_mfa, degraded}
    deactivate DE

    note right
      FAIL OPEN: lỗi / timeout / degraded
      → vẫn cấp token, chỉ ghi log.
      Không bao giờ khoá cả hệ thống
      vì Detection sập.
    end note

    alt risk HIGH or CRITICAL
        CA -> CA : detection_mfa_once = true
        CA -> CDB : INSERT login_attempt\n(outcome=mfa_required)
        CA -> CDB : INSERT mfa_transaction\n(status=pending)
        note right: **Chưa tạo session,\nchưa có token**
        CA --> U : **200 MFA_REQUIRED**\n{mfa_required: true}
        deactivate CA
    else risk LOW or MEDIUM
        CA -> CDB : INSERT login_attempt\n(outcome=success)
        CA -> CDB : INSERT session\n(token_jti, access_hash,\nrefresh_hash, expires_at)
        note right: core-db.sessions
        CA --> U : **200 OK**\n{access_token, refresh_token}
        deactivate CA
    end

    == MFA Verify (chi tiết tại WF-4) ==

    U -> CA : **POST /api/v1/auth/mfa/verify**\n(transaction_id, mfa_code)
    activate CA

    CA -> CDB : SELECT mfa_transaction WHERE id
    activate CDB
    CDB --> CA : transaction record
    deactivate CDB

    CA -> CA : Verify OTP (hash compare)

    alt code INVALID / expired / IP mismatch
        CA -> CDB : UPDATE mfa_transaction\n(status=failed, fail_count+1)
        CA --> U : **401 MFA failed**
        deactivate CA
    else code VALID
        CA -> CDB : UPDATE mfa_transaction\n(status=completed)
        CA -> CDB : INSERT login_attempt\n(outcome=mfa_success)
        CA -> CDB : INSERT session
        CA --> U : **200 OK**\n{access_token, refresh_token}
        deactivate CA
    end
end

legend bottom
  **v3.3:**
  - Core App giao tiếp Detection Engine qua HTTP (X-Internal-Secret)

  **2026-10-05 (risk gate):**
  - Core App hỏi /internal/pre-token-check **đồng bộ** trước khi cấp token
  - chỉ HIGH/CRITICAL bị giữ token và bắt MFA; LOW/MEDIUM cấp token ngay
  - FAIL OPEN: lỗi/timeout → vẫn cho đăng nhập
  - Thay đổi này **phá vỡ** mô hình "không gọi detection ngay".
    Outbox pattern vẫn là thiết kế đích nhưng chưa hiện thực.
  - Xem WF-2 và DECISIONS-DETECTION-v3.3.md mục 10
endlegend

@enduml
